        "translation": "Momo 请大人在身边陪一会儿。朋友们晚安，按自己的节奏休息。",
        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "bedtime.story.5.intro",
            "text": "Momo asks our grown-up to stay nearby.",
            "audio": "bedtime.story.5.intro.audio"
          },
          {
            "id": "bedtime.story.5.item",
            "text": "Goodnight, friends. We can rest in our own time.",
